# Repository CMS Docs

This `Docs/` directory is the current documentation source for Repository CMS until the Adlaire documentation migration is complete.

The future canonical documentation repository is `Adlaire-Docs`.

After the migration, this repository must treat `Adlaire-Docs` as the canonical source for specifications, design, cross-project development planning, cross-project change history, brand policy, security policy, data protection policy, and release policy.

Repository CMS is the first applied project of Adlaire Ecosystem.

Read `Docs/Document_Source` for the migration source policy.
